\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" fill=\"none\"><g id=\"fi_18214701\"><path id=\"Vector\" d=\"M16.6095 1.97585C13.4647 3.00809 9.45582 5.76872 5.75898 10.4978L3.57448 8.07325C3.2384 7.68916 2.61426 7.68916 2.27818 8.07325L0.669812 9.87366C0.357741 10.2337 0.381746 10.7619 0.717823 11.0739L5.66295 15.827C6.07105 16.2111 6.7432 16.1151 7.03127 15.611C9.67187 10.8339 12.5045 7.28107 17.3056 3.20013C17.8818 2.69602 17.3536 1.7358 16.6095 1.97585Z\" fill=\"white\"></path></g></svg>						\n										2 ngày Camp “Đồ Án tốt nghiệp” tuần 10\n									</li>\n								<li>\n							<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" fill=\"none\"><g id=\"fi_18214701\"><path id=\"Vector\" d=\"M16.6095 1.97585C13.4647 3.00809 9.45582 5.76872 5.75898 10.4978L3.57448 8.07325C3.2384 7.68916 2.61426 7.68916 2.27818 8.07325L0.669812 9.87366C0.357741 10.2337 0.381746 10.7619 0.717823 11.0739L5.66295 15.827C6.07105 16.2111 6.7432 16.1151 7.03127 15.611C9.67187 10.8339 12.5045 7.28107 17.3056 3.20013C17.8818 2.69602 17.3536 1.7358 16.6095 1.97585Z\" fill=\"white\"></path></g></svg>						\n										Hỗ trợ Online từ Coach-Mentor bất cứ khi nào trong suốt 3 tháng\n									</li>\n								<li>\n							<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 18 18\" fill=\"none\"><g id=\"fi_18214701\"><path id=\"Vector\" d=\"M16.6095 1.97585C13.4647 3.00809 9.45582 5.76872 5.75898 10.4978L3.57448 8.07325C3.2384 7.68916 2.61426 7.68916 2.27818 8.07325L0.669812 9.87366C0.357741 10.2337 0.381746 10.7619 0.717823 11.0739L5.66295 15.827C6.07105 16.2111 6.7432 16.1151 7.03127 15.611C9.67187 10.8339 12.5045 7.28107 17.3056 3.20013C17.8818 2.69602 17.3536 1.7358 16.6095 1.97585Z\" fill=\"white\"></path></g></svg>						\n										Hoàn tiền 100% nếu học viên không hài lòng trong 7 ngày đầu.\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n			<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"99\" height=\"67\" viewBox=\"0